<title>USA: AES files for listing on the NYSE.</title>
<headline>AES files for listing on the NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AES Corp said it filed an application with the New York Stock Exchange for the listing of its common stock.</p>
<p>AES, a power company, has over $2.8 billion in assets and, for the year ending Dec. 31, 1995, earned net income of $107 million on revenues of $685 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
